{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"lvzang-e-o014","title":"布将士抄掠绍患忌遣壮士夜掩杀不获布走河内合张杨","accounts":[{"id":"lvzang-a-f61e92724acd1dd638a5","label":"正文","text":"布将士抄掠绍患忌遣壮士夜掩杀不获布走河内合张杨","evidence":["lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-707a98f80066e1888fdc","label":"裴注·英雄记","text":"布轻傲绍下诸将求还洛绍假领司隶校尉内欲杀布","evidence":["lvzang-q-471396e1ce8f2ad5c3bd"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-cdefdc5437f1786383a5","label":"裴注·英雄记","text":"绍遣甲士送布布伪鼓筝出帐兵乱斫床被布引去","evidence":["lvzang-q-dd6b91d3d319f28fcd22"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"求益兵众、将士抄掠、觉绍意从绍求去、走河内与张杨合；自以有功于袁氏轻傲绍下诸将、以为擅相署置不足贵也、求还洛；使止于帐侧、伪使人于帐中鼓筝、无何出帐去而兵不觉、遂引去","evidence":["lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66","lvzang-q-471396e1ce8f2ad5c3bd","lvzang-q-dd6b91d3d319f28fcd22"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"患忌之、恐还为己害遣壮士夜掩杀布、令众追之；假布领司隶校尉、外言当遣内欲杀布；遣甲士三十人辞以送布、兵夜半起乱斫布床被谓为已死、明日讯问知布尚在乃闭城门","evidence":["lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66","lvzang-q-471396e1ce8f2ad5c3bd","lvzang-q-dd6b91d3d319f28fcd22"]},{"person":"wudi-p0123","role":"与布合","evidence":["lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66","lvzang-q-471396e1ce8f2ad5c3bd","lvzang-q-dd6b91d3d319f28fcd22"]},"ordering_evidence":"lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66","source_order":[7,35,104],"order":1797}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0123","name":"张杨","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lvzang-q-471396e1ce8f2ad5c3bd","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-a78f12643658c8f80e43","layer":"pei","quote":"布自以有功于袁氏，轻傲绍下诸将；以为擅相署置，不足贵也。布求还洛，绍假布领司隶校尉：外言当遣，内欲杀布","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c4804c8fb87a1d97aef5","start":11,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-9a35c4110cb4e28acc66","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d7dccb90aa40b28ae072","layer":"original","quote":"而求益兵众，将士抄掠；绍患忌之。布觉其意，从绍求去；绍恐还为己害，遣壮士夜掩杀布。不获，事露，布走河内，﹝二﹞与张杨合。绍令众追之，皆畏布，莫敢逼近者","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":104,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-dd6b91d3d319f28fcd22","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-a78f12643658c8f80e43","layer":"pei","quote":"明日当发，绍遣甲士三十人，辞以送布。布使止于帐侧，伪使人于帐中鼓筝。绍兵卧，布无何出帐去，而兵不觉。夜半兵起，乱斫布床被，谓为已死。明日，绍讯问，知布尚在，乃闭城门。布遂引去","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c4804c8fb87a1d97aef5","start":63,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
